# 默认按文本处理，防止 Windows 换行符污染
* text=auto

# 模型与贴图：二进制，禁止 diff / 换行转换
*.obj binary
*.mtl text
*.fbx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.tga binary
*.exr binary
*.hdr binary

# ---------- Git LFS（默认不启用） ----------
# 需要托管 .spp / .max 时，取消下面两行注释并执行：
#   git lfs install && git add .gitattributes
#
# *.spp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.max filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---------- 文档 ----------
*.md text eol=lf
